    {
      "name": "Bristle Flash",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "light",
        "visual"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The tashtari causes their filaments to glow with intense light. Non-tashtari creatures within a 40ft Type:emanation must attempt a DC 19 Fortitude Saving Throw save. A creature that attempts this save is immune to all Bristle Flashes for 1 minute. The tashtari's fur then dims, and they can't use this ability until they bask in sunlight for at least 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Dazzled for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is dazzled for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 1 minute.</p>",
